          <h3 class="journal-title" data-i18n="journal.t1">The Date Palms of Madinah</h3>
          <div class="journal-ar" data-i18n="journal.ar1">من نخيل المدينة</div>
          <p class="journal-excerpt" data-i18n="journal.e1">A morning walked between the rows of palms at Quba — counting the slow harvest of Ajwa, Sukkari, and Anbara.</p>
