            <span data-i18n="journal.k2">CHRONICLE · 02</span>
            <span data-i18n="journal.d2">WINTER · MMXXVI</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="journal-title" data-i18n="journal.t2">A Letter on Slowness</h3>
          <div class="journal-ar" data-i18n="journal.ar2">رسالةٌ في التأنّي</div>
          <p class="journal-excerpt" data-i18n="journal.e2">We do not measure our parcels by speed. They are measured by the steadiness of the hand that folds the linen.</p>
