        <figcaption>
          <span class="t-name" data-i18n="te.n1">Yasmin El-Sayed</span>
          <span class="t-loc" data-i18n="te.l1">Heliopolis, Cairo</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="t-card reveal delay-1">
        <div class="t-mark">"</div>
        <blockquote data-i18n="te.q2">We ordered eighty bespoke Ramadan boxes for our team. Each one arrived with the recipient's name written in Naskh. Not a single corner was rushed.</blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          <span class="t-name" data-i18n="te.n2">Omar Hosny</span>
