<!-- ——————————————— FAQ ——————————————— -->
<section class="faq" id="faq" data-screen-label="10 FAQ">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-layout">
      <div>
        <div class="reveal eyebrow" data-i18n="fq.eyebrow">— IX · Questions</div>
        <h2 class="display reveal delay-1" data-i18n-html="fq.title">A few <em>asked,</em><br/>quietly <em>answered.</em></h2>
        <p class="lede reveal delay-2" data-i18n="fq.sub">If yours is not here, write to us at hello@irthmadina.com — we reply personally, within one working day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list reveal delay-2">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span data-i18n="fq.q1">Where are IRTH products made?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
          <p data-i18n="fq.a1">Every piece is hand-assembled in our atelier in Cairo. The prayer rugs are woven in collaboration with weavers from Akhmim, the misbahas are strung in-house, and the dates are sourced from Madinah and Siwa.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span data-i18n="fq.q2">How long does delivery take?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
          <p data-i18n="fq.a2">Stock pieces ship within 48 hours. Bespoke gifts take 5–7 working days. All deliveries inside Egypt are free and white-glove. International is available on request.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span data-i18n="fq.q3">Can I add a dedication card?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
          <p data-i18n="fq.a3">Yes — every order includes a folded card written in Naskh script by our in-house calligrapher, addressed to the recipient by name. Dedications up to 40 words are complimentary.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span data-i18n="fq.q4">Do you offer corporate gifting?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
          <p data-i18n="fq.a4">Yes. We compose bespoke corporate boxes from 25 pieces upward, with co-branded Certificates of Authenticity and dedications for each recipient. Minimum 14 days lead time.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span data-i18n="fq.q5">What is your return policy?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
          <p data-i18n="fq.a5">Stock pieces may be returned, unopened, within 7 days for a full refund. Bespoke and personalised pieces are final sale. We replace any damaged piece, no questions asked.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span data-i18n="fq.q6">How do I care for the prayer rug?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
          <p data-i18n="fq.a6">Shake gently, do not machine-wash. Spot clean with a damp cloth. Once a year, air it for an afternoon in indirect sun — never direct. With this, it will outlast you.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

